Subject: [PATCH] fix(fairness): preserve export progress and classify unknown
 evidence [daveey]

Review fixes: replace oversized lifecycle rows with explicit oversize loss while atomically advancing the journal cursor; use finite source-time validation for huge JSON integers; distinguish unknown trigger integrity from observed trigger loss. Pin current journal behaviour and exercise first/middle/last oversized rows plus forged capture CLI classification. Correct the writer docstring: caller-sized batches are not a runtime queue memory guarantee. RED: overflow2, oversized3, trigger2. GREEN:307 fairness tests; all21 checks.
